sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant DSPO as DSPO Controller<br/>SA: controller-manager
    participant MariaDB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP TLS configurable
    participant ObjStore as Object Store<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCIReg as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OSAPIServer as OpenShift APIServer CR

    Note over User,OSAPIServer: Flow 1: DSPA Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update DSPA CR<br/>Auth: RBAC
    K8sAPI->>DSPO: Watch event (DSPA changed)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Read Secrets (DB creds, ObjStore creds)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>DSPO: Secret data

    Note over DSPO: Health Check Phase
    DSPO->>MariaDB: Database connectivity check<br/>Username/password auth
    MariaDB-->>DSPO: Connection OK
    DSPO->>ObjStore: Object store connectivity check<br/>Static creds or IAM
    ObjStore-->>DSPO: Connection OK

    Note over DSPO: Component Reconciliation (ordered)
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply Common resources<br/>ServiceAccount token
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply Webhook resources
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply ManagedPipelines
    DSPO->>OCIReg: Fetch pipeline manifests<br/>Registry credentials
    OCIReg-->>DSPO: OCI manifests
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply APIServer Deployment
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply PersistenceAgent Deployment
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply ScheduledWorkflow Deployment
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply WorkflowController Deployment
    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Apply MLMD Deployment (last - TLS deps)

    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Update DSPA status conditions<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>User: DSPA status: Ready

    Note over User,OSAPIServer: Flow 2: TLS Profile Initialization

    DSPO->>K8sAPI: Get APIServer CR<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>DSPO: TLS profile (e.g., Intermediate)
    Note over DSPO: Configure webhook :9443<br/>and metrics :8443 TLS

    loop SecurityProfileWatcher
        DSPO->>K8sAPI: Watch APIServer CR changes
        K8sAPI-->>DSPO: TLS profile changed
        Note over DSPO: Graceful restart
    end
